      "modifications": [
        "Packed all upstream regular UTF-8 files and directory entries into JSON; decoded strings retain exact bytes, including CRLF, bare CR and terminal-newline state. The per-scenario SHA-256 map refers to the original upstream files.",
        "The replay suite explicitly expects scenario 015 to reject during whole-patch preflight and leave its original empty input unchanged, rather than retain the earlier Add.",
        "Scenario 014 is retained verbatim: its input actually ends in LF at this commit. A separate downstream regression removes only that final LF and expects the update not to add it back."
      ]
    }
